# First Steps (sectors 1 and 2; the temporary finish stands right after checkpoint 2).
# Concept v3, sector 1 "First steps": steering only, in order -- the start, a first corner, a stair of little steps,
# a hairpin, a hump and a descent with a pocket holding an extra life, straight rails, a zigzag, a ledge along a
# wall, rails with a bend, a planked bridge, a balcony and the way to checkpoint 1. Railings both sides almost
# everywhere (they thin out in the zigzag, the first time), a wide groove track, a sunset over a sea of cloud.
# Edit this file and run `scripts/own-levels.sh assets/levels/01_First_Roll`.
